You didn't say what kind of a computer you use, but if you use the msdos
version, you can replace the dark blue with light blue by adding the 
following line to your nethack.cnf:

VIDEOCOLORS = 4 2 6 9 5 3 12 10 14 9 13 11

..and you can change the dark gray to light gray with the following line:

VIDEOSHADES = normal normal light

I am not sure if these features are implemented for the other operating
systems.. they are described in the msdos.hlp file.
